  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Drinks and Preferences</h2>\n<p>The speaker has a clear preference for hot chocolate and expresses a dislike for coffee and soda. Multiple statements indicate a strong aversion to coffee, describing it as &#x27;bitter&#x27; and &#x27;too bitter.&#x27; In contrast, the speaker enjoys milk tea and refers to it positively, while continuing to express a dislike for coffee.</p>\n<h2>Friendships and Social Relationships</h2>\n<p>The speaker frequently refers to their friends using the term &#x27;BFF,&#x27; which stands for &#x27;best friend forever.&#x27; This term is closely associated with the Japanese concept of &#x27;nakama,&#x27; which is described as a deep and lasting friendship. The speaker also mentions several friends, including Gura, Amelia, Kiara, and Ina, and references specific experiences, such as traveling to the &#x27;nether&#x27; with them.</p>\n<h2>Minecraft and Gaming Activities</h2>\n<p>The speaker is enthusiastic about playing Minecraft and has plans to play with friends such as Gura and potentially Kiara. They also mention a new friend named &#x27;strider&#x27; and express confusion about where &#x27;strider&#x27; is located. The speaker invites others to join them in playing Minecraft and specifically mentions &#x27;shark&#x27; as someone they would like to play with.</p>\n<h2>Personal Interests and Hobbies</h2>\n<p>The speaker has a variety of interests, including gaming, music, and colors. They mention a favorite game, &#x27;Bloodborne,&#x27; and express a preference for the color red. They also enjoy music, particularly rap.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BQ9rYbkmQcc</p>",
